  "worked_solution": "The elements of $B$ are all the terms of the *recursive* sequence ${b}_{n},$ given by\n\n$$\n{b}_{n+1}={b}_{n}+5,\\,{b}_{1}=2,\\,n\\in N.\n$$\n\nLet's write down the first few terms of our sequence:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{1} & =2 \\\\ {b}_{2} & ={b}_{1}+5 \\\\  & =2+5 \\\\  & =7 \\\\ {b}_{3} & ={b}_{2}+5 \\\\  & =7+5 \\\\  & =12 \\\\ {b}_{4} & ={b}_{3}+5 \\\\  & =12+5 \\\\  & =17 \\\\  & \u22ee\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\nB={2,7,12,17,\u2026}.\n$$",
